The Global Wrestling Federation is an American wrestling promotion founded in 1991. The promotion was created after the fall of the World Class promotion and the failure of the USWA to capture the Dallas marketplace. While the GWF was a new promotion in 1991, it was billed as part of a global wrestling empire and started off with quite the fanfare and expectation.
